  "observations": [
    "CONFIRMED Business Plan Context Gap: BusinessPlanHandler receives only Canonical Idea Core and Clarifier Output, omitting TAM/SAM/SOM market study findings and Business Model Canvas blocks despite BusinessPlanController requiring their completion.",
