    "God Service Hotspot: CompanyService.cs spans 5,952 lines across 121 public methods driving all 9 entrepreneur phases.",
    "Marketplace Direct DB Bypass: MarketplaceProjectsController queries Companies, CreatorIdeas, and Investments directly without an intermediate domain service."
